| 🔴 Critical | 2 | Triple regex chain in Underscore; per-match allocations in Pascalize |
| 🟡 Moderate | 4 | Camelize slice; InflectionRule compiled regex budget; Underscore regexes not source-gen; .ToLower() culture |
